  "bruteCheckDomains": "all valid p,q<=60 (exhaustive), 1500 fixed-seed random valid pairs over the full domain (seed 568002), every one of the 10991 exact-equality fractions pi(n)/rub(n) of suffix records with p,q<=10^4, every extra, and literal scans for p,q<=8 with answer<3000.",
